b:T2b05,<p>This Acceptable Use Policy ("Policy") sets out the rules for using the services provided by <strong>Smile Agri-Market Technologies Ltd</strong> ("Smile Agri-Market," "Company," "we," "our," or "us") through <a href="https://smileagrimarket.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>https://smileagrimarket.com</strong></a>, our mobile applications, APIs, and related services (collectively, the "Platform").</p>
<p>This Policy applies to all users, including buyers, sellers, farmers, cooperatives, logistics providers, warehouses, consultants, financial partners, advertisers, visitors, and any other person or organization using the Platform.</p>
<p>By accessing or using the Platform, you agree to comply with this Policy, our Terms & Conditions, Privacy Policy, Seller Policy, Buyer Policy, and all applicable laws.</p>
<h2>1. Purpose</h2>
<p>Smile Agri-Market is committed to maintaining a safe, secure, transparent, and trustworthy digital marketplace for agriculture.</p>
<p>This Policy explains acceptable and prohibited uses of the Platform and helps protect our users, business partners, and systems.</p>
<h2>2. Compliance with Laws</h2>
<p>You must use the Platform only for lawful purposes.</p>
<p>You agree to comply with all applicable:</p>
<ul><li>Local laws</li><li>State laws</li><li>National laws</li><li>International laws where applicable</li><li>Agricultural regulations</li><li>Consumer protection laws</li><li>Food safety regulations</li><li>Environmental laws</li><li>Tax laws</li><li>Export and import regulations</li><li>Data protection and privacy laws</li></ul>
<h2>3. Account Integrity</h2>
<p>You must:</p>
<ul><li>Register using accurate information.</li><li>Keep your account information current.</li><li>Maintain the confidentiality of your password.</li><li>Immediately report unauthorized access to your account.</li><li>Use only your own account unless expressly authorized.</li></ul>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Create fake accounts.</li><li>Share accounts with unauthorized persons.</li><li>Buy or sell user accounts.</li><li>Impersonate another individual, business, or organization.</li></ul>
<h2>4. Marketplace Integrity</h2>
<p>Users must act honestly and fairly.</p>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Misrepresent products or services.</li><li>Post misleading descriptions or photographs.</li><li>Artificially inflate prices.</li><li>Manipulate market prices.</li><li>Circumvent Platform fees.</li><li>Create fake transactions.</li><li>Interfere with legitimate marketplace activity.</li></ul>
<h2>5. Fraud Prevention</h2>
<p>The following activities are strictly prohibited:</p>
<ul><li>Identity theft.</li><li>Payment fraud.</li><li>Credit card fraud.</li><li>Money laundering.</li><li>Financial scams.</li><li>Investment scams.</li><li>Pyramid or Ponzi schemes.</li><li>Forged documentation.</li><li>False verification documents.</li><li>Chargeback abuse.</li><li>Refund fraud.</li><li>Delivery fraud.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market may report suspected criminal activity to the appropriate authorities.</p>
<h2>6. Prohibited Products and Services</h2>
<p>Users must not advertise, list, sell, or facilitate transactions involving products or services that are illegal or prohibited by applicable law or by Smile Agri-Market policies.</p>
<p>Examples include:</p>
<ul><li>Counterfeit goods.</li><li>Stolen property.</li><li>Unsafe or contaminated food products.</li><li>Expired products represented as fit for sale.</li><li>Illegal pesticides or chemicals.</li><li>Protected wildlife or endangered species.</li><li>Fraudulent investment opportunities.</li><li>Products that infringe intellectual property rights.</li><li>Any product prohibited by law.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market may remove prohibited listings without prior notice.</p>
<h2>7. Respectful Conduct</h2>
<p>Users must treat others with respect.</p>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Harass others.</li><li>Threaten violence.</li><li>Use abusive language.</li><li>Discriminate against users.</li><li>Engage in bullying.</li><li>Publish defamatory content.</li><li>Encourage illegal activity.</li><li>Intimidate or stalk other users.</li></ul>
<h2>8. User Content</h2>
<p>Users are responsible for the content they upload, including:</p>
<ul><li>Product listings.</li><li>Reviews.</li><li>Comments.</li><li>Images.</li><li>Videos.</li><li>Messages.</li><li>Documents.</li></ul>
<p>Content must:</p>
<ul><li>Be truthful.</li><li>Be lawful.</li><li>Respect intellectual property rights.</li><li>Not contain malware or harmful code.</li><li>Not infringe privacy rights.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market may remove content that violates this Policy.</p>
<h2>9. Intellectual Property</h2>
<p>You must respect the intellectual property rights of others.</p>
<p>You may not:</p>
<ul><li>Copy copyrighted material without permission.</li><li>Use another company's trademark without authorization.</li><li>Upload pirated content.</li><li>Remove copyright notices.</li><li>Misuse Smile Agri-Market's trademarks, logos, branding, or proprietary content.</li></ul>
<h2>10. Platform Security</h2>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Attempt unauthorized access to any account, server, database, or network.</li><li>Interfere with Platform security.</li><li>Circumvent authentication measures.</li><li>Probe, scan, or test system vulnerabilities without written authorization.</li><li>Introduce viruses, worms, ransomware, spyware, or other malicious software.</li><li>Disrupt or impair Platform operations.</li></ul>
<h2>11. Automated Access</h2>
<p>Unless expressly authorized in writing by Smile Agri-Market, you must not:</p>
<ul><li>Scrape Platform content.</li><li>Use bots to create accounts.</li><li>Harvest email addresses or phone numbers.</li><li>Use automated tools to collect user information.</li><li>Conduct unauthorized data mining.</li><li>Overload or interfere with Platform systems through automated requests.</li></ul>
<p>Approved API access, where offered, must comply with applicable API documentation and usage limits.</p>
<h2>12. Communications</h2>
<p>Users must not use the Platform to send:</p>
<ul><li>Spam.</li><li>Chain letters.</li><li>Unsolicited advertising.</li><li>Fraudulent messages.</li><li>Malicious links.</li><li>Phishing communications.</li><li>Malware attachments.</li></ul>
<p>Communications through the Platform should relate to legitimate marketplace activities.</p>
<h2>13. Reviews and Ratings</h2>
<p>Reviews should reflect genuine experiences.</p>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Submit fake reviews.</li><li>Offer incentives for undisclosed positive reviews.</li><li>Post retaliatory reviews.</li><li>Manipulate seller or buyer ratings.</li><li>Create multiple accounts to influence ratings.</li></ul>
<h2>14. Data Protection</h2>
<p>You must respect the privacy of others.</p>
<p>You must not:</p>
<ul><li>Collect personal information without authorization.</li><li>Publish another person's personal information without consent.</li><li>Sell user information obtained through the Platform.</li><li>Use Platform data for unauthorized marketing.</li></ul>
<p>Personal information obtained through the Platform may only be used for legitimate transaction-related purposes unless otherwise authorized.</p>
<h2>15. AI and Technology Features</h2>
<p>If you use AI-powered tools available through the Platform, you must not:</p>
<ul><li>Attempt to manipulate AI systems.</li><li>Use AI outputs to deceive others.</li><li>Generate fraudulent listings.</li><li>Create misleading agricultural or investment information.</li><li>Reverse engineer proprietary AI systems.</li></ul>
<p>AI-generated information should be used responsibly and does not replace professional advice.</p>
<h2>16. Advertising</h2>
<p>Advertisements placed on the Platform must:</p>
<ul><li>Be truthful.</li><li>Comply with applicable laws.</li><li>Clearly identify sponsored content where required.</li><li>Not contain misleading claims.</li><li>Not promote prohibited products or services.</li></ul>
<p>Smile Agri-Market reserves the right to reject or remove advertisements at its discretion.</p>
<h2>17. Monitoring and Enforcement</h2>
<p>To protect the Platform and its users, Smile Agri-Market may:</p>
<ul><li>Review user-generated content.</li><li>Investigate reports of misconduct.</li><li>Suspend or remove listings.</li><li>Restrict Platform features.</li><li>Request additional verification.</li><li>Suspend or terminate accounts.</li><li>Report suspected unlawful activity to relevant authorities where appropriate.</li></ul>
<p>Our monitoring activities are conducted in accordance with applicable privacy and data protection laws.</p>
<h2>18. Reporting Violations</h2>
<p>Users who become aware of suspected violations of this Policy are encouraged to report them through our customer support channels.</p>
<p>Reports should include, where possible:</p>
<ul><li>A description of the issue.</li><li>Relevant order or listing information.</li><li>Supporting documents or screenshots.</li><li>Any other information that may assist our investigation.</li></ul>
<p>We review reports in good faith but cannot guarantee a particular outcome.</p>
<h2>19. Consequences of Violations</h2>
<p>Depending on the nature and severity of the violation, Smile Agri-Market may:</p>
<ul><li>Issue a warning.</li><li>Remove content.</li><li>Suspend listings.</li><li>Temporarily suspend an account.</li><li>Permanently terminate an account.</li><li>Withhold payouts where permitted by law and reasonably necessary.</li><li>Restrict access to Platform features.</li><li>Refer matters to law enforcement or regulatory authorities where appropriate.</li><li>Pursue other remedies available under applicable law.</li></ul>
<p>Serious or repeated violations may result in permanent removal from the Platform.</p>
<h2>20. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may amend this Acceptable Use Policy from time to time.</p>
<p>Material changes will be posted on the Platform with a revised Effective Date.</p>
<p>Continued use of the Platform after the effective date of any changes constitutes acceptance of the updated Policy.</p>
<h2>21. Governing Law</h2>
<p>This Policy is governed by the laws of the Federal Republic of Nigeria.</p>
<p>Nothing in this Policy limits any rights or obligations arising under mandatory applicable laws.</p>
<h2>22. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Acceptable Use Policy or wish to report a violation, please contact:</p>
<p><strong>Smile Agri-Market Technologies Ltd</strong></p>
<p>Website: <a href="https://smileagrimarket.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><strong>https://smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>
<p>General Support: <a href="mailto:support@smileagrimarket.com"><strong>support@smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>
<p>Legal Enquiries: <a href="mailto:legal@smileagrimarket.com"><strong>legal@smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>
<p>Abuse Reports: <a href="mailto:abuse@smileagrimarket.com"><strong>abuse@smileagrimarket.com</strong></a></p>6:["$","main",null,{"className":"container-page py-12 sm:py-16","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-[0.7rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted-foreground","children":"Legal"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl","children":"Acceptable Use Policy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":["Effective date: ","July 9, 2026"," · Last updated:"," ","July 9, 2026"]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"mt-10 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&_a]:font-medium [&_a]:text-leaf-600 [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-4 [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h3]:mt-7 [&_h3]:text-base [&_h3]:font-semibold [&_h3]:text-ink [&_li]:mt-2 [&_ol]:mt-4 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_p]:mt-4 [&_strong]:font-semibold [&_strong]:text-ink [&_ul]:mt-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$b"}}],"$Lc"]}]}]
